      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yayo, mukala wamashi! Wenzala namazu akutwamba nikubuwabuwa; yuma yakupupawu hiyamanaŋaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yikoti vupu vupu, tufumbu twamakálu kalakata kalakata, tuwalu tukutumboka, makálu akumotoka motoka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akwatuwalu akulotoka lotoka, mpoku jatubali keji keji, mayoba be-be-be, nyilaŋalaŋa yawafu, nyilumba yayivuvuma, yibimbi yawu hiyakumaŋaaku hiyakudimbukila hayibimbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinafumi hamawuvumbi achivumbi walubanji, yena mumbanda himwanta wyuma yakupandapanda, walandishaŋa nyuza yawantu kumawuvumbi indi, walandishaŋa yisaka yawantu kuyuma yindi yakupandapanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wamazaza nindi, Tiya, nidi neyi nandombu, nakakuvúula jisanya jeyi hadi antu, nakaleja nyuza yawantu iheŋu deyi, nakaleja nimatuŋa awantu wusonyi weyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakakwasola wuzondu watama nankashi, nakakutamisha nankashi, nakakusha hatooka kulonda antu akakutali akakuhayami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu ejima akakutala akakuchina, akela nawu, Nineve washeshekadehi; akumudila kudinyi? Akwakumukundeja nukuyiwana kudihi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Komana eyi wunabadiki Nowamoni wadiŋi mukachi katuloŋa, wadiŋi nameji niniku niniku kwi-ndo, mpwembu yindi yowu kaluŋalwiji, mbaŋu yindi yamunyeŋumuka wowu meji akaluŋalwiji nawa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋovu jindi jafumini kudi aEtiyopiya nawaEjipitu, Ŋovu jindi jakakumaŋa; aPuti nawaLibiya diwu adiŋi ankwashi jindi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela chochu, amutweli kwawu, wayili muwukoli. Anyanindi anyanya ayichikachikili kunsa janyikwakwa yejima. Antu indi alema ayisakwili nayinjikijilu yakusakula nachu; antu indi asweja kutiyakana ayikasili mumaleŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakasheta walwa, wakabatama; wakakeŋakeŋa kwakudikaŋila kwakola nansaŋu yachilumbu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyikala yeyi yejima yakuhata muyipaka yakekala neyi yikuyu yahaŋahu dehi, kulukumunaku hiyikuholokela namutunwa twawakwakudya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiya, amayala adi mweyeyi hiyambanda tuhu kwawu, yisu yakumpwembu jamwituŋa deyi yachashi tuhu, kulonda ayilumbu jeyi epili. Nyikomenu yeyi yanoŋa dehi nakesi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tahaku meji, keŋa akukuchiki; koleshaku nyikala yeyi yakuhata yipaka. Iŋila muwina, wuchaaki maseki, wunoni chikombola chakutuŋa nachu matafwali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kesi kakakunoŋesha kwenoku; mpoku yakabali yakakufumishahu, yakakuvwota neyi atubola achidi kumotoka. Kadivulishi neyi atubola achidi kumotoka, kadivulishi neyi atubola aweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wunavulishi akwakulandujola eyi, kubadika tutumbwa twamwiwulu kuvula. Atubola achidi kumotoka hiyakutandama nakukisaŋana, nkumininaku hiyakuditúukila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu eyi avwikawu yibaŋula adi neyi atubola, anyanta jeyi amajita adi neyi mazaza ampasu ateekaŋa kumakoli hefuku dachishika, chidikusela itaŋwa hiyakuditúukila, kwosi niniwu wukwiluka kwaduwu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
